{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》陳瀅大膽裸露演出引爆全城熱話，最近更有傳張曦雯在劇中亦有場僅穿內褲的場面，但正式拍攝時突然遭特別要求，以無剪接的一鏡到底鏡頭，直接拍攝她脫去上衣大露背、僅穿底褲的畫面，張曦雯拒絕臨時加戲，最後卻出現了「劇本問題」而全</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T13:20:05.166029+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:10:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:15:24.212406+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T13:15:24.212406+00:00","content_hash":"b2505b81612004dbf53dacf8cc34161922c8656baac08bbea7e148fa2b2da89e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}